in Beverly Hills.


01:09:40.100 --> 01:09:41.200
Attractive how?


01:09:49.500 --> 01:09:52.000
What do you want
to talk about, Jesse?


01:09:52.100 --> 01:09:52.700
Baseball.


01:09:54.100 --> 01:09:56.500
Do you have someone
in Paradise?


01:09:57.400 --> 01:09:57.865
I did.


01:09:57.900 --> 01:10:00.500
But you' re not
seeing anyone now?


01:10:01.000 --> 01:10:02.200
I'm seeing you.


01:10:04.900 --> 01:10:06.400
How about those Sox?


01:10:16.800 --> 01:10:17.500
Well...


01:10:31.000 --> 01:10:32.700
It's been a long time.


01:10:40.800 --> 01:10:43.400
TAXI DRIVER:
Want me to come back?


01:10:48.400 --> 01:10:49.600
Keep the change.


01:10:50.200 --> 01:10:52.200
There won't be any change.


01:10:53.300 --> 01:10:54.900
Well, keep it anyway.


01:10:58.900 --> 01:10:59.700
Good night.


01:11:00.900 --> 01:11:01.700
Good night.


01:11:37.200 --> 01:11:43.200
_Aid you do?


01:11:44.200 --> 01:11:47.300
I hit somebody in the fist
with my face.


01:11:48.700 --> 01:11:49.600
So, Jesse...


01:11:51.300 --> 01:11:54.400
is there anything you need
to talk about?


01:11:55.400 --> 01:11:58.500
Did Molly call you
or did Rose call you?


01:11:58.600 --> 01:11:59.700
Rose called me.


01:12:00.200 --> 01:12:00.800
She's...


01:12:01.200 --> 01:12:01.900
Concerned?


01:12:03.200 --> 01:12:04.900
How are you with blood?


01:12:05.400 --> 01:12:07.300
I see blood all the time.


01:12:07.800 --> 01:12:10.600
It's just usually
child blood rather


01:12:11.000 --> 01:12:12.300
than big people blood.
Doc,


01:12:12.400 --> 01:12:15.300
you are rapidly spiraling
into pediatrician talk.


01:12:15.400 --> 01:12:16.000
Sorry, Jesse.


01:12:16.100 --> 01:12:19.700
I need your expert, grownup
medical examiner opinion here.


01:12:19.800 --> 01:12:20.400
Okay.


01:12:20.900 --> 01:12:23.700
Somebody gets shot,
do they bleed right away?


01:12:23.800 --> 01:12:24.900
Not necessarily.


01:12:27.600 --> 01:12:29.300
I'm studying at night.


01:12:29.500 --> 01:12:30.065
Good.


01:12:30.100 --> 01:12:33.300
So a gunshot victim might not
leave a blood trail


01:12:33.400 --> 01:12:34.400
at the scene.


01:12:34.800 --> 01:12:35.600
Exactly.


01:12:36.700 --> 01:12:37.300
So...


01:12:38.800 --> 01:12:40.200
did I answer your question?


01:12:40.300 --> 01:12:42.400
Oh, I think I know the answer.


01:12:42.500 --> 01:12:45.100
I just wanted
to be sure you did.


01:12:45.600 --> 01:12:47.100
I want you
out of my town.


01:12:47.200 --> 01:12:48.900
Your town?
That's right.


01:12:49.000 --> 01:12:50.900
What are you, the sheriff?


01:12:51.900 --> 01:12:52.265
Chief Stone?


01:12:52.300 --> 01:12:53.900
Hey, I'm just here
for field training.


01:12:54.000 --> 01:12:56.000
I'm missing some
personal property.


01:12:56.100 --> 01:12:58.800
Did you misplace
the item or items?


01:12:59.400 --> 01:13:00.900
I think it was stolen.


01:13:01.000 --> 01:13:01.700
I see.


01:13:02.300 --> 01:13:03.000
A theft.


01:13:03.200 --> 01:13:04.000
Well, during
your abbreviated


01:13:04.100 --> 01:13:06.800
stay in Paradise,
we aim to protect and serve,


01:13:06.900 --> 01:13:10.300
so, just what are you missing,
Mr. Pendleton?


01:13:11.400 --> 01:13:14.200
Uh, perhaps I did
misplace the items.


01:13:16.000 --> 01:13:16.700
How's tomorrow?


01:13:16.800 --> 01:13:18.200
How's after the race?


01:13:18.300 --> 01:13:19.400
How's tomorrow?


01:13:22.900 --> 01:13:23.600
Oh, well.


01:13:24.500 --> 01:13:25.500
Mr. Pendleton?


01:13:26.000 --> 01:13:26.700
Yes?


01:13:27.500 --> 01:13:28.500
Shame on you.


01:13:33.500 --> 01:13:34.400
How'd I do?


01:13:34.800 --> 01:13:36.600
Officially, I'm shocked.


01:13:36.700 --> 01:13:37.500
Unofficially.


01:13:37.600 --> 01:13:38.700
I'm proud of you.


01:13:38.800 --> 01:13:40.400
What would you have done,
Jesse?


01:13:40.500 --> 01:13:42.400
I would have
slugged him.


01:13:48.400 --> 01:13:50.000
Skipper, what happened?


01:13:50.300 --> 01:13:51.000
I fell.


01:13:51.100 --> 01:13:51.900
Where'


01:13:52.300 --> 01:13:53.100
Orthodontist.


01:13:53.200 --> 01:13:54.300
Where's Suit?
Market.


01:13:54.400 --> 01:13:55.600
He said to let you know


01:13:55.700 --> 01:13:57.700
that Captain
Healy called.


01:13:58.100 --> 01:13:59.000
Hey, Skipper,


01:13:59.300 --> 01:14:02.900
do you think I could have
the day off tomorrow?


01:14:11.600 --> 01:14:14.900
Are Gino Fish and his
receptionist an item?


01:14:15.300 --> 01:14:16.800
You got a problem
with that?


01:14:16.900 --> 01:14:19.200
Hey, I'm just
accumulating data.


01:14:19.300 --> 01:14:21.400
Your in-laws
still visiting?


01:14:21.500 --> 01:14:23.200
That's what they call it.


01:14:23.300 --> 01:14:26.200
What did you find out
about Terry Genest?


01:14:26.300 --> 01:14:27.800
Well, he prefers Terence.


01:14:27.900 --> 01:14:29.200
Just got out of prison.


01:14:29.300 --> 01:14:30.500
Freelance gunsel.


01:14:30.700 --> 01:14:32.800
Works for Gino
on occasión.


01:14:33.000 --> 01:14:34.400
Bit of a
loose cannon.


01:14:34.500 --> 01:14:35.300
Cokehead.


01:14:35.400 --> 01:14:37.100
You better be a
little careful.


01:14:37.200 --> 01:14:37.900
Everybody says that.


01:14:38.000 --> 01:14:41.600
The material on the robber's
clothes was blood.


01:14:43.000 --> 01:14:45.500
Now, we' re no going to get
much more out of it.


01:14:45.600 --> 01:14:47.000
It was pretty degraded.


01:14:47.100 --> 01:14:48.200
Oh, and I also, uh,


01:14:48.300 --> 01:14:51.600
ran that check that
Suitcase said you wanted.


01:14:51.700 --> 01:14:52.300
And?


01:14:52.700 --> 01:14:53.265
Dead end.


01:14:53.300 --> 01:14:57.200
There were no accidental
gunshot wounds in May ' 92.


01:14:58.400 --> 01:15:01.500
I also checked, uh, New
Hampshire and Rhode Island.


01:15:01.600 --> 01:15:02.900
You' re thorough.


01:15:03.100 --> 01:15:03.700
I am.


01:15:04.000 --> 01:15:07.400
And I don't know what
this other thing's about.


01:15:07.500 --> 01:15:08.400
Is he okay?


01:15:08.700 --> 01:15:13.100
He's not quite in the same pond
with the other ducks yet.


01:15:13.500 --> 01:15:14.800
What "other thing"?


01:15:14.900 --> 01:15:15.900
Well, he wanted me to, uh,


01:15:16.000 --> 01:15:20.000
run a background check on
L.A. resident Leeann Lewis.


01:15:20.700 --> 01:15:21.400
Because?


01:15:23.200 --> 01:15:24.600
He said he had a feeling.


01:15:24.700 --> 01:15:27.200
He's been having
a lot of those.


01:15:29.100 --> 01:15:30.800
Uh, the only thing
we got was


01:15:30.900 --> 01:15:32.100
she was reported
missing once.


01:15:32.200 --> 01:15:34.200
Landlady filed
the report.


01:15:34.300 --> 01:15:37.100
Well, she left
to take care of her mom.


01:15:37.200 --> 01:15:38.800
Anyway, it went away.


01:15:39.300 --> 01:15:42.700
And she sent the landlady
an apology and money


01:15:42.800 --> 01:15:43.900
to pay off the lease.


01:15:44.000 --> 01:15:45.400
And that was May ' 92.


01:15:45.500 --> 01:15:46.600
You mean ' 94.


01:15:46.900 --> 01:15:47.600
No...


01:15:49.300 --> 01:15:52.200
she was reported missing
May 23, 1992.


01:15:53.100 --> 01:15:54.300
That's the, uh,


01:15:54.400 --> 01:15:57.000
that's the same date
as the robbery.


01:15:57.100 --> 01:15:58.400
Is that important?


01:15:59.400 --> 01:16:00.000
Jesse?


01:16:03.000 --> 01:16:05.300
That report list an occupation?


01:16:06.000 --> 01:16:07.100
Uh, yeah. Um...


01:16:08.600 --> 01:16:09.400
Waitress.


01:16:11.900 --> 01:16:13.700
Where was her residence?


01:16:14.600 --> 01:16:15.300
Inglewood.


01:17:07.400 --> 01:17:07.800
Jesse.


01:17:08.700 --> 01:17:09.700
What happened?


01:17:09.900 --> 01:17:10.700
I fell.


01:17:12.600 --> 01:17:14.100
You got some coffee?


01:17:17.800 --> 01:17:18.600
Long drive.


01:17:19.800 --> 01:17:20.600
Lot of traffic?


01:17:20.700 --> 01:17:24.300
Actually, I had to make sure
I wasn't followed.


01:17:25.400 --> 01:17:27.200
Turns out there
was a lot of money


01:17:27.300 --> 01:17:28.500
in Hasty's bank-
mob money.


01:17:28.600 --> 01:17:31.100
And I've been getting
the distinct impressión


01:17:31.200 --> 01:17:33.600
they'd like to have
what's left of it back.


01:17:33.700 --> 01:17:35.900
Do you think you were followed?


01:17:36.000 --> 01:17:38.000
I know I wasn't.
How do you know?


01:17:38.100 --> 01:17:40.600
I'm good at what
I do, Rebecca.


01:17:44.300 --> 01:17:45.400
Oh, I'm sorry.


01:17:45.900 --> 01:17:48.800
It's just that you and
your sister look so much alike.


01:17:48.900 --> 01:17:52.700
Of course, if Leeann was dressed
as a man, you wouldn't look


01:17:52.800 --> 01:17:54.900
anything like her, would you?


01:17:57.700 --> 01:17:58.700
I screwed up.


01:18:00.200 --> 01:18:00.800
I know better.


01:18:00.900 --> 01:18:02.500
It's not just men
who rob banks.


01:18:02.600 --> 01:18:05.300
It's not just men
who kill people.


01:18:13.300 --> 01:18:14.900
I didn't kill anyone.


01:18:16.100 --> 01:18:18.800
You mean, you didn't
shoot anybody.


01:18:21.600 --> 01:18:23.400
Look, it's just a theory so far,


01:18:23.500 --> 01:18:25.400
but it's a pretty good theory.


01:18:25.500 --> 01:18:27.400
Shouldn't be too hard to prove.


01:18:27.500 --> 01:18:29.400
You went to the dentist
as a kid.


01:18:29.500 --> 01:18:32.000
Dental records,
fingerprints, DNA.


01:18:34.100 --> 01:18:35.800
Something will tell us.


01:18:37.300 --> 01:18:38.400
And then what?


01:18:39.400 --> 01:18:41.600
Then I'll have to arrest you.


01:18:45.800 --> 01:18:49.900
Will you give me time
to make arrangements for my mom?


01:18:51.800 --> 01:18:52.900
Yeah, your mom.


01:18:56.800 --> 01:18:59.000
How much money
you got left?


01:18:59.100 --> 01:18:59.900
Not a lot.


01:19:00.700 --> 01:19:01.600
Enough to...


01:19:02.100 --> 01:19:04.600
Enough to make sure
I can take care of her.


01:19:04.700 --> 01:19:07.800
When you go to jail,
they take it away.


01:19:09.300 --> 01:19:11.000
I talked Leeann into it


01:19:12.800 --> 01:19:14.600
when I found out
how much money


01:19:14.700 --> 01:19:17.300
there was going
through that bank.


01:19:17.900 --> 01:19:19.500
We never had anything.


01:19:19.700 --> 01:19:22.300
We thought
we were going to travel


01:19:23.200 --> 01:19:25.100
and do anything we wanted.


01:19:28.500 --> 01:19:30.200
It just seemed so easy.


01:19:30.400 --> 01:19:32.500
We thought we were so smart.


01:19:32.600 --> 01:19:33.600
It was smart.


01:19:35.900 --> 01:19:39.100
WOMAN
Light to moderate training...


01:19:39.200 --> 01:19:40.900
Unintended consequences.


01:19:43.100 --> 01:19:47.100
The bank guard hit what
he was aiming at, didn't he?


01:19:47.600 --> 01:19:51.400
Leeann died where we planned
to change our clothes,


01:19:52.000 --> 01:19:52.600
so I...


01:19:56.900 --> 01:20:00.200
I put my clothes on her,
and I buried her.


01:20:04.800 --> 01:20:05.700
Mutual fund companies


01:20:05.800 --> 01:20:07.200
are reporting
first quarter vestment...


01:20:07.300 --> 01:20:10.600
What do you think's going
to happen to her


01:20:11.400 --> 01:20:13.100
after I take you away?


01:20:22.500 --> 01:20:23.900
Oh, what the hell.


01:20:29.300 --> 01:20:32.000
You won't be hearing
from me again.


01:20:42.900 --> 01:20:44.800
What was that kiss about?


01:20:46.400 --> 01:20:47.000
You.


01:20:48.600 --> 01:20:50.500
I'd like to believe that.


01:21:03.400 --> 01:21:05.565
Platinum rose three dollars...


01:21:05.600 --> 01:21:08.400
FISH: Did you find what
you were looking for?


01:21:08.500 --> 01:21:12.600
I did. I found the money
Hasty was laundering for you.


01:21:14.700 --> 01:21:15.500
Hasty who?


01:21:15.900 --> 01:21:17.100
Let's not do this again.


01:21:17.200 --> 01:21:18.800
I don't know
what you' re talking about.


01:21:18.900 --> 01:21:22.800
If we' re going to be pals,
we have to find a way


01:21:22.900 --> 01:21:25.300
to be more honest
with each other.


01:21:25.400 --> 01:21:26.000
Ah.


01:21:26.600 --> 01:21:28.200
Not completely honest?


01:21:29.300 --> 01:21:30.200
More honest.


01:21:31.400 --> 01:21:32.100
Well...


01:21:33.200 --> 01:21:34.000
You first.


01:21:36.200 --> 01:21:37.800
Assuming I were interested


01:21:37.900 --> 01:21:39.900
in the whereabouts
of this money,


01:21:40.000 --> 01:21:41.800
what could
you tell me?


01:21:41.900 --> 01:21:45.300
A woman robbed the bank
and has used up most of it


01:21:45.400 --> 01:21:47.700
taking care of her sick mother.


01:21:55.100 --> 01:21:57.900
You don't really expect me
to believe that?


01:21:58.000 --> 01:21:58.800
Not really.


01:22:00.900 --> 01:22:03.600
You don't know
where the money is?


01:22:04.900 --> 01:22:05.700
Not really.


01:22:09.100 --> 01:22:11.000
I'll pull off Mr. Genest.


01:23:13.400 --> 01:23:14.700
Jesse, it's Rose.


01:23:15.500 --> 01:23:16.600
Where are you?


01:23:55.000 --> 01:23:55.600
Hello?


01:23:59.000 --> 01:23:59.600
Hello?

